==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Morelull|147}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's illustration rare print forms a {{TCG|narrative illustration}} with the illustration rare print of {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Cutiefly|167}}; both cards are illustrated by [[kamonabe]].
*'''Stampede''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Phanpy|62}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

